```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner serve --help
Connect to Scherzo Cloud and serve run assignments

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner serve [OPTIONS] --gateway-url <URL> --credential-file <PATH> --workflow-id <WORKFLOW_ID> --workflow-source-root <ROOT> --workflow-path <PATH> --work-root <ROOT>

Options:
      --gateway-url <URL>            WebSocket URL of the runner gateway
      --credential-file <PATH>       Path to the private development runner credential file
      --allow-insecure-http          Permit ws:// only for an explicit loopback development gateway URL
      --workflow-id <WORKFLOW_ID>    Cloud workflow ID mapped by this development runner
      --workflow-source-root <ROOT>  Directory boundary for the registered workflow's local sources (must already exist)
      --workflow-path <PATH>         Workflow YAML path selected within the workflow source root
      --work-root <ROOT>             Directory for runner-owned execution roots (must already exist)
  -h, --help                         Print help

```
